      "title": "Optical Cloud Penetration Boundary",
      "detail": "Optical sensor wavelengths (RGB) cannot penetrate optically thick opaque clouds. The model performs contextual inpainting based on visible neighboring terrain and statistical priors, not true physical surface observation."
    },
