      "limitation_id": "LIM-2",
      "title": "Internal Holdout Evaluation Scope",
      "detail": "The 144 validation patches are an internal holdout split from official SEN12MS-CR training ROI 102 (Winter). Benchmark test ROIs were not acquired or evaluated; global domain generalization remains unmeasured."
    },
    {
      "limitation_id": "LIM-3",
      "title": "Cross-Sensor Non-Transferability (LISS-IV)",
      "detail": "Evaluating the Sentinel-2 RGB model on Resourcesat-2A LISS-IV is blocked due to 5m vs 10m spatial resolution mismatch, Green-Red-NIR vs RGB spectral mismatch (no blue band), and missing ESUN solar irradiance calibration metadata in official LISS-IV product deliverables."
    }
  ]
